{"id":"hubschrauber","lemma":"Hubschrauber","pos":"noun","rank":2251,"glosses":["helicopter"],"ipa":"/ˈhuːpˌʃraʊ̯bər/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/52/De-Hubschrauber.ogg/De-Hubschrauber.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Hubschraubers","plural":"Hubschrauber"},"examples":[{"text":"Hast du wirklich einen Hubschrauber gesehen?","en":"Did you really see a helicopter?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"really, actually"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"}]},{"text":"Ich kann Hubschrauber fliegen.","en":"I know how to fly a helicopter.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,{"g":"to fly"}]},{"text":"Sie wurden per Hubschrauber gerettet.","en":"They were rescued by helicopter.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"by"},null,{"g":"to save, to rescue","l":"retten"}]},{"text":"Ein Hubschrauber kreiste über uns.","en":"A helicopter circled over us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/484860","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to circle, to wheel","l":"kreisen"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"}]},{"text":"Er weiß, wie man einen Hubschrauber fliegt.","en":"He knows how to fly a helicopter.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to fly","l":"fliegen"}]}]}